  "sharedChangeRequests": [
    {
      "owner": "Git/schema/workflow single-writer",
      "paths": [
        "db/schema.ts",
        "drizzle/",
        "lib/operations.ts",
        "lib/workflow.ts",
        "systems/rock-star-os/src/blackberryrock/wallet.py"
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "Reuse existing wallet_journals/wallet_postings and reservation authority, not a new balance ledger. Web book_records are self-bookkeeping, not authenticated external cash.",
        "Globally UNIQUE(provider,eventId) bound to eventSha256 and UNIQUE(provider,chain,transactionId,transferId); do not scope uniqueness by owner/receipt/asset. Load eventClaim globally and reject aliases.",
        "In one existing authority transaction, recheck authenticated owner, writer epoch/trust revision, current revocation and independent query proof; CAS expectedRevision plus immutable intent hash, insert event claim and proposal projection atomically. Retry same key after lost commit outcome.",
        "Pure seam returns zero credit, never a posting authorization. Accepting a real rail needs a separate reviewed adapter, signed-key/finality/contract acceptance and funding policy; no caller may turn confirmed_candidate into available.",
        "Refund/reorg append original-journal-linked compensating postings exactly once, never edit history. Reconcile holds/settled/spent amounts before any availability correction; unknown outcome retains reservation and queries first.",
        "Add real storage concurrency/restart/crash-before-after-commit tests for duplicates, aliases and linked reversal; current checkpoint tests serialize/reload fixtures only."
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "Git/Billing/Provider manifest single-writer",
      "paths": [
        "lib/financial-provider.ts",
        "lib/earning-bridge.ts",
        "lib/sky-stripe.ts",
        "docs/sky-billing.md"
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "Review wallet-rail-policy/1 operation extension as proposal only: deposit and sales each explicitly opt into receive; fee_collection requires collect_platform_fee and existing allocation; payout requires payout. Keep Rock collector restricted to fee/reporting.",
        "Sales remain earning_reconciliation_required until existing same-owner completed non-sample execution/tool/time/currency receipt is reconciled to unique finalized external funds; do not allocate from job success.",
        "Preserve legacy fee888c fixture cap; never use it as general deposit cap. USD16 basic fee and invoices remain Billing, separate from cash/deposit/general revenue allocation. No transport or balance change in this unit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "Git/design/progress single-writer",
      "paths": [
        "docs/rockstaros-complete-design.md",
